  "name": "3_AggregationOnStructuredApi",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "#Grouping sets, rollup, cube\n[ref link](https://learnsql.com/blog/sql-grouping-sets-clause/)\n\n**NOTE**\n```\nGrouping sets depend on null values for aggregation levels. If you do not filter-out null values, you\nwill get incorrect results. This applies to cubes, rollups, and grouping sets\n```",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
